  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Orok_mystic.jpg\" title=\"Frosty Mystic\"><img alt=\"Frosty Mystic\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"240\" src=\"/images/Orok_mystic.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Orok_mystic.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Frosty Mystic</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race: </b> Orok\n</p><p><b>Class: </b>Mage\n</p><p>Orok Mystics/Shamans use a ranged bolt attack, such as fire or ice, appropriate to the type they are.  They will stand back and fire, and attempt to keep distance between you and them.  This sometimes makes it possible to \"chase\" them as they try to get away.  In addition to their ranged bolt attack, these Mystics will heal themselves and also heal damaged enemies in the vicinity.  Be sure to eliminate these healers as quickly as possible.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Mystic\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Mystic\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Subtterrorania</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Arborgeddon</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Haterium</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fire Orok Mystic\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Orok Mystic\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Supply_Depot\" title=\"Vergrim's Supply Depot\">Vergrim's Supply Depot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Mystic Mosher\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Z'lash's_Pad\" title=\"Z'lash's Pad\">Z'lash's Pad</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frosty Mystic\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Xhelduh's_Hideout\" title=\"Xhelduh's Hideout\">Xhelduh's Hideout</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cave Shaman\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Clan_of_the_Cave_Yetti\" title=\"Clan of the Cave Yetti\">Clan of the Cave Yetti</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blood Mystic\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Store Room 1A</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[HAX] Shaman\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Haxhaxor Libratorium</a> off <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
